{
  "_about": [
    "Which sound each character makes, and when (AUD-05, AUD-06, AUD-08). Files are",
    "assets/audio/sfx/<group>/<sound>_<n>.mp3 (made by tools/voice/sfx.py); a random take plays, never",
    "the same one twice in a row. A sound is \"group/sound\", or an object with s (that), chance (0..1),",
    "volume and delay_s. In a list, sounds without a chance always play; of those with one, a single",
    "roll picks at most one (so chances 0.75 and 0.25 mean one or the other). {ground} becomes grass or",
    "dirt from the ground underfoot.",
    "Events: step (footfalls, steps_per_cycle per walk/run loop), alert (spots Rowan), attack (enemy",
    "melee), light / heavy / cast (Rowan), release (a caster's spell leaves the hand), hit, death,",
    "idle (now and then while wandering, every idle_every_s), startled (Rowan swings nearby).",
    "Sounds fade with distance (full within ref_m, silent past max_m) and pan with the camera.",
    "Per kind, also: cycle_events {clip: [[phase 0..1, event]]} fires once per loop of that clip;",
    "state_events {state: {enter, leave}} fires on entering/leaving a state; clip_loops {clip: sound}",
    "keeps a looping sound going while that clip plays. wade_step replaces any footstep in water.",
    "greet: an NPC with a voice speaks when Rowan walks up (once per 45 s). {voice} is that NPC's",
    "voice (data/characters.json 'voices'); lines are assets/audio/vo/<voice>/<event>_<n>.mp3.",
    "'like': another kind's sounds (the unique villagers sound like villager_m / villager_f).",
    "jump / land: Rowan's take-off (a grunt, sometimes) and landing (two footfalls).",
    "draw / sheathe: Rowan drawing the Dawnblade and putting it on his back."
  ],
  "volume": 1.0,
  "ref_m": 4.0,
  "max_m": 45.0,
  "steps_within_m": 22.0,
  "min_gap_s": 0.3,
